    "perplexity": {
      "description": "From Us To You is EMF’s 30th Anniversary Boxset, a career-spanning collection that brings together the band’s early-1990s breakthrough era and a deep archive of unreleased material. The set includes vinyl editions of the three studio albums Schubert Dip (1991), Stigma (1992), and Cha Cha Cha (1995), along with a rarities compilation titled Flipsides And Bona Fides that gathers rare and previously unavailable songs.\n\nThe boxset also adds a reproduction of the band’s original demo cassette, a cassette of Schubert Dip demos, a never-before-heard interview recorded in 2020, and a fourth LP devoted to rarities, B-sides, and nine unreleased demos spanning two decades. Framed by EMF’s blend of electronic, rock, and pop, the collection highlights both the group’s hook-heavy mainstream appeal and the wider, more experimental edges of their catalogue, making it a compact overview of their first 30 years as a band.",
